WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.912
This version uses RANK instead of ROW_NUMBER.

00:00:02.912 --> 00:00:10.042
If two employees share the second-highest salary, both can receive rank two and both can pass the rank

00:00:10.042 --> 00:00:12.362
less than or equal to two condition.

00:00:12.362 --> 00:00:16.992
That means the output may contain more than two employees in a department.

00:00:16.992 --> 00:00:20.592
Choose this behavior when ties should be included.

00:00:20.592 --> 00:00:24.712
Ranking functions differ mainly in how they handle ties.

00:00:24.712 --> 00:00:31.747
ROW_NUMBER forces a unique sequence, RANK leaves gaps after ties, and DENSE_RANK does not.

00:00:31.747 --> 00:00:35.647
Add deterministic tie-breakers when a unique order matters;

00:00:35.647 --> 00:00:39.920
otherwise two executions can choose different rows among tied values.
